      { title: 'Clusters', detail: '5+ connected fruits (8-way) pay. Cascades clear wins and drop fresh fruit.' },
      { title: 'Jar wild', detail: 'Jars substitute in clusters. Each win that includes a jar bumps that jar’s multiplier by +1.' },
